[2026-03-16T03:32:50.785Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VeqTczQ4iR87CRkqVkLktu","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Skill\n     2→\n     3→Changes to the app fall into a couple categories which are handled differently.\n     4→\n     5→* Minor changes to the styling and UI are not covered by tests and can be updated freely.\n     6→  Make these changes directly, then update AppRevisions.md to note the change so that it is not\n     7→  accidentally reverted later.\n     8→\n     9→* Changes to functionality must be treated as bug reports.\n    10→  Go through the process outlined in `addBugReport.md`\n    11→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02a601b0-a58d-4ced-bb22-f466b267f498","uuid":"f17ce215-afcf-433f-83bc-92b23d6ca15d","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/skills/messages/changeApp.md","content":"# Skill\n\nChanges to the app fall into a couple categories which are handled differently.\n\n* Minor changes to the styling and UI are not covered by tests and can be updated freely.\n  Make these changes directly, then update AppRevisions.md to note the change so that it is not\n  accidentally reverted later.\n\n* Changes to functionality must be treated as bug reports.\n  Go through the process outlined in `addBugReport.md`\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
[2026-03-16T03:32:50.790Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wh7MeQ97ZZLY2fYWBVCF5u","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# AirbnbClone - Vacation Rental Marketplace\n     2→\n     3→## Overview\n     4→\n     5→A vacation rental marketplace where hosts can list properties and guests can browse, search, and book stays. The app features property listings with photos, search and filtering, a booking system, user profiles, reviews, and a host dashboard.\n     6→\n     7→## Data Model\n     8→\n     9→### Users\n    10→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    11→- `email` (text, unique, not null)\n    12→- `name` (text, not null)\n    13→- `avatar_url` (text, nullable)\n    14→- `bio` (text, nullable)\n    15→- `phone` (text, nullable)\n    16→- `is_host` (boolean, default false)\n    17→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    18→\n    19→### Properties\n    20→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    21→- `host_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n    22→- `title` (text, not null)\n    23→- `description` (text, not null)\n    24→- `property_type` (text, not null) — \"Apartment\", \"House\", \"Cabin\", \"Villa\", \"Condo\", \"Loft\", \"Cottage\", \"Townhouse\"\n    25→- `price_per_night` (numeric, not null)\n    26→- `cleaning_fee` (numeric, default 0)\n    27→- `max_guests` (integer, not null)\n    28→- `bedrooms` (integer, not null)\n    29→- `beds` (integer, not null)\n    30→- `bathrooms` (integer, not null)\n    31→- `address` (text, not null)\n    32→- `city` (text, not null)\n    33→- `state` (text, nullable)\n    34→- `country` (text, not null)\n    35→- `latitude` (numeric, nullable)\n    36→- `longitude` (numeric, nullable)\n    37→- `check_in_time` (text, default '15:00')\n    38→- `check_out_time` (text, default '11:00')\n    39→- `is_active` (boolean, default true)\n    40→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    41→- `updated_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    42→\n    43→### Property Images\n    44→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    45→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n    46→- `url` (text, not null)\n    47→- `caption` (text, nullable)\n    48→- `display_order` (integer, default 0)\n    49→\n    50→### Amenities\n    51→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    52→- `name` (text, unique, not null)\n    53→- `icon` (text, nullable)\n    54→- `category` (text, not null) — \"Essentials\", \"Features\", \"Safety\", \"Location\"\n    55→\n    56→### Property Amenities (join table)\n    57→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id)\n    58→- `amenity_id` (UUID, FK → amenities.id)\n    59→- PK: (property_id, amenity_id)\n    60→\n    61→### Bookings\n    62→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    63→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n    64→- `guest_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n    65→- `check_in` (date, not null)\n    66→- `check_out` (date, not null)\n    67→- `num_guests` (integer, not null)\n    68→- `total_price` (numeric, not null)\n    69→- `status` (text, not null) — \"pending\", \"confirmed\", \"cancelled\", \"completed\"\n    70→- `special_requests` (text, nullable)\n    71→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    72→\n    73→### Reviews\n    74→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    75→- `booking_id` (UUID, FK → bookings.id, unique, not null)\n    76→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n    77→- `guest_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n    78→- `rating` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    79→- `cleanliness` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    80→- `accuracy` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    81→- `communication` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    82→- `location` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    83→- `value` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    84→- `comment` (text, nullable)\n    85→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    86→\n    87→### Favorites\n    88→- `user_id` (UUID, FK → users.id)\n    89→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id)\n    90→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    91→- PK: (user_id, property_id)\n    92→\n    93→## Pages\n    94→\n    95→### 1. Login / Register Page (`/login`)\n    96→- Simple email-based login (no password for simplicity — enter email, get logged in)\n    97→- Registration form with name, email fields\n    98→- Toggle between login and register modes\n    99→- After login, redirect to home page\n   100→- Store current user in Redux state\n   101→\n   102→### 2. Home / Search Page (`/`)\n   103→- **Search bar** at top: location text input, check-in date, check-out date, number of guests\n   104→- **Category filter bar**: horizontal scrollable chips for property types (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, etc.)\n   105→- **Property grid**: responsive grid of property cards\n   106→  - Each card shows: main image, property type badge, title, city/country, price per night, average rating with review count\n   107→  - Heart icon to favorite/unfavorite (if logged in)\n   108→  - Clicking card navigates to property detail page\n   109→- **Filters panel** (toggle open/close): price range slider, bedrooms min, beds min, bathrooms min, amenity checkboxes\n   110→- Pagination or infinite scroll for results\n   111→\n   112→### 3. Property Detail Page (`/properties/:id`)\n   113→- **Image gallery**: grid layout showing property images (main large image + smaller thumbnails)\n   114→- **Property header**: title, city/country, rating summary, review count, host name with avatar\n   115→- **Property info section**: property type, guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms\n   116→- **Description**: full property description text\n   117→- **Amenities list**: grouped by category with icons\n   118→- **Booking card** (sticky sidebar on desktop):\n   119→  - Price per night display\n   120→  - Check-in / check-out date pickers\n   121→  - Guest count selector\n   122→  - Price breakdown: nightly rate x nights, cleaning fee, total\n   123→  - \"Reserve\" button (must be logged in, cannot book own property)\n   124→- **Reviews section**: average ratings by category (cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value), individual review cards with guest name, date, rating, comment\n   125→- **Host info card**: host name, avatar, bio, member since date, number of listings\n   126→\n   127→### 4. My Trips Page (`/trips`)\n   128→- Requires login\n   129→- Tabs: \"Upcoming\", \"Past\", \"Cancelled\"\n   130→- Each trip card shows: property image, property title, city, dates, status badge, total price\n   131→- Click trip card to see booking details\n   132→- Cancel button for pending/confirmed bookings (with confirmation dialog)\n   133→- \"Write Review\" button for completed bookings without a review\n   134→\n   135→### 5. Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n   136→- Requires login and host status\n   137→- **Stats overview**: total listings, active bookings, total earnings, average rating\n   138→- **Listings tab**: grid of host's properties with edit/deactivate actions\n   139→- **Bookings tab**: table of bookings for host's properties with status filters\n   140→  - Host can confirm or cancel pending bookings\n   141→- **Add Listing button**: opens a multi-step form to create a new property\n   142→  - Step 1: Property type and title\n   143→  - Step 2: Location (address, city, state, country)\n   144→  - Step 3: Details (guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms)\n   145→  - Step 4: Amenities selection (checkboxes grouped by category)\n   146→  - Step 5: Photos (URL input for image URLs)\n   147→  - Step 6: Pricing (price per night, cleaning fee)\n   148→  - Step 7: Review and publish\n   149→\n   150→### 6. User Profile Page (`/profile`)\n   151→- Requires login\n   152→- View/edit name, bio, phone, avatar URL\n   153→- \"Become a Host\" button (if not already a host)\n   154→- List of user's reviews they've written\n   155→\n   156→### 7. Write Review Page (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)\n   157→- Requires login\n   158→- Rating sliders for: overall, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value\n   159→- Text comment area\n   160→- Submit button\n   161→- Shows property info and booking dates for context\n   162→\n   163→## API Endpoints (Netlify Functions)\n   164→\n   165→### Auth\n   166→- `POST /api/auth` — Login/register by email. Returns user object.\n   167→\n   168→### Users\n   169→- `GET /api/users/:id` — Get user profile\n   170→- `PUT /api/users/:id` — Update user profile\n   171→- `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` — Set is_host to true\n   172→\n   173→### Properties\n   174→- `GET /api/properties` — List properties with search/filter query params (city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, min_price, max_price, min_bedrooms, min_beds, min_bathrooms, amenities, page, limit)\n   175→- `GET /api/properties/:id` — Get property detail with images, amenities, host info\n   176→- `POST /api/properties` — Create property (host only)\n   177→- `PUT /api/properties/:id` — Update property (owner only)\n   178→- `DELETE /api/properties/:id` — Deactivate property (owner only)\n   179→\n   180→### Property Images\n   181→- `POST /api/property-images` — Add image to property\n   182→- `DELETE /api/property-images/:id` — Remove image\n   183→\n   184→### Bookings\n   185→- `GET /api/bookings` — Get current user's bookings (as guest)\n   186→- `GET /api/host-bookings` — Get bookings for host's properties\n   187→- `POST /api/bookings` — Create booking\n   188→- `PUT /api/bookings/:id` — Update booking status (confirm/cancel)\n   189→\n   190→### Reviews\n   191→- `GET /api/reviews?property_id=X` — Get reviews for a property\n   192→- `POST /api/reviews` — Create review for a completed booking\n   193→\n   194→### Favorites\n   195→- `GET /api/favorites` — Get current user's favorites\n   196→- `POST /api/favorites` — Add favorite\n   197→- `DELETE /api/favorites/:propertyId` — Remove favorite\n   198→\n   199→### Amenities\n   200→- `GET /api/amenities` — List all amenities\n   201→\n   202→## Visual Design\n   203→\n   204→- Clean, modern design inspired by Airbnb's aesthetic\n   205→- White/light gray background with coral/red accent color (#FF5A5F)\n   206→- Rounded cards with subtle shadows\n   207→- Clean typography using system fonts\n   208→- Responsive layout: 1 column mobile, 2 columns tablet, 3-4 columns desktop for property grid\n   209→- Property cards with rounded corners, image at top, info below\n   210→- Sticky booking sidebar on property detail page (desktop)\n   211→- Collapsible navigation sidebar with icons for: Home/Search, My Trips, Hosting, Profile\n   212→- Star ratings displayed with filled/unfilled stars\n   213→- Status badges: pending (yellow), confirmed (green), cancelled (red), completed (blue)\n   214→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02a601b0-a58d-4ced-bb22-f466b267f498","uuid":"82fee3c5-d507-483b-b0ed-ee01c8e60b08","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/AppSpec.md","content":"# AirbnbClone - Vacation Rental Marketplace\n\n## Overview\n\nA vacation rental marketplace where hosts can list properties and guests can browse, search, and book stays. The app features property listings with photos, search and filtering, a booking system, user profiles, reviews, and a host dashboard.\n\n## Data Model\n\n### Users\n- `id` (UUID, PK)\n- `email` (text, unique, not null)\n- `name` (text, not null)\n- `avatar_url` (text, nullable)\n- `bio` (text, nullable)\n- `phone` (text, nullable)\n- `is_host` (boolean, default false)\n- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n\n### Properties\n- `id` (UUID, PK)\n- `host_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n- `title` (text, not null)\n- `description` (text, not null)\n- `property_type` (text, not null) — \"Apartment\", \"House\", \"Cabin\", \"Villa\", \"Condo\", \"Loft\", \"Cottage\", \"Townhouse\"\n- `price_per_night` (numeric, not null)\n- `cleaning_fee` (numeric, default 0)\n- `max_guests` (integer, not null)\n- `bedrooms` (integer, not null)\n- `beds` (integer, not null)\n- `bathrooms` (integer, not null)\n- `address` (text, not null)\n- `city` (text, not null)\n- `state` (text, nullable)\n- `country` (text, not null)\n- `latitude` (numeric, nullable)\n- `longitude` (numeric, nullable)\n- `check_in_time` (text, default '15:00')\n- `check_out_time` (text, default '11:00')\n- `is_active` (boolean, default true)\n- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n- `updated_at` (timestamp, default now)\n\n### Property Images\n- `id` (UUID, PK)\n- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n- `url` (text, not null)\n- `caption` (text, nullable)\n- `display_order` (integer, default 0)\n\n### Amenities\n- `id` (UUID, PK)\n- `name` (text, unique, not null)\n- `icon` (text, nullable)\n- `category` (text, not null) — \"Essentials\", \"Features\", \"Safety\", \"Location\"\n\n### Property Amenities (join table)\n- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id)\n- `amenity_id` (UUID, FK → amenities.id)\n- PK: (property_id, amenity_id)\n\n### Bookings\n- `id` (UUID, PK)\n- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n- `guest_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n- `check_in` (date, not null)\n- `check_out` (date, not null)\n- `num_guests` (integer, not null)\n- `total_price` (numeric, not null)\n- `status` (text, not null) — \"pending\", \"confirmed\", \"cancelled\", \"completed\"\n- `special_requests` (text, nullable)\n- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n\n### Reviews\n- `id` (UUID, PK)\n- `booking_id` (UUID, FK → bookings.id, unique, not null)\n- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n- `guest_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n- `rating` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n- `cleanliness` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n- `accuracy` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n- `communication` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n- `location` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n- `value` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n- `comment` (text, nullable)\n- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n\n### Favorites\n- `user_id` (UUID, FK → users.id)\n- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id)\n- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n- PK: (user_id, property_id)\n\n## Pages\n\n### 1. Login / Register Page (`/login`)\n- Simple email-based login (no password for simplicity — enter email, get logged in)\n- Registration form with name, email fields\n- Toggle between login and register modes\n- After login, redirect to home page\n- Store current user in Redux state\n\n### 2. Home / Search Page (`/`)\n- **Search bar** at top: location text input, check-in date, check-out date, number of guests\n- **Category filter bar**: horizontal scrollable chips for property types (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, etc.)\n- **Property grid**: responsive grid of property cards\n  - Each card shows: main image, property type badge, title, city/country, price per night, average rating with review count\n  - Heart icon to favorite/unfavorite (if logged in)\n  - Clicking card navigates to property detail page\n- **Filters panel** (toggle open/close): price range slider, bedrooms min, beds min, bathrooms min, amenity checkboxes\n- Pagination or infinite scroll for results\n\n### 3. Property Detail Page (`/properties/:id`)\n- **Image gallery**: grid layout showing property images (main large image + smaller thumbnails)\n- **Property header**: title, city/country, rating summary, review count, host name with avatar\n- **Property info section**: property type, guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms\n- **Description**: full property description text\n- **Amenities list**: grouped by category with icons\n- **Booking card** (sticky sidebar on desktop):\n  - Price per night display\n  - Check-in / check-out date pickers\n  - Guest count selector\n  - Price breakdown: nightly rate x nights, cleaning fee, total\n  - \"Reserve\" button (must be logged in, cannot book own property)\n- **Reviews section**: average ratings by category (cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value), individual review cards with guest name, date, rating, comment\n- **Host info card**: host name, avatar, bio, member since date, number of listings\n\n### 4. My Trips Page (`/trips`)\n- Requires login\n- Tabs: \"Upcoming\", \"Past\", \"Cancelled\"\n- Each trip card shows: property image, property title, city, dates, status badge, total price\n- Click trip card to see booking details\n- Cancel button for pending/confirmed bookings (with confirmation dialog)\n- \"Write Review\" button for completed bookings without a review\n\n### 5. Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n- Requires login and host status\n- **Stats overview**: total listings, active bookings, total earnings, average rating\n- **Listings tab**: grid of host's properties with edit/deactivate actions\n- **Bookings tab**: table of bookings for host's properties with status filters\n  - Host can confirm or cancel pending bookings\n- **Add Listing button**: opens a multi-step form to create a new property\n  - Step 1: Property type and title\n  - Step 2: Location (address, city, state, country)\n  - Step 3: Details (guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms)\n  - Step 4: Amenities selection (checkboxes grouped by category)\n  - Step 5: Photos (URL input for image URLs)\n  - Step 6: Pricing (price per night, cleaning fee)\n  - Step 7: Review and publish\n\n### 6. User Profile Page (`/profile`)\n- Requires login\n- View/edit name, bio, phone, avatar URL\n- \"Become a Host\" button (if not already a host)\n- List of user's reviews they've written\n\n### 7. Write Review Page (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)\n- Requires login\n- Rating sliders for: overall, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value\n- Text comment area\n- Submit button\n- Shows property info and booking dates for context\n\n## API Endpoints (Netlify Functions)\n\n### Auth\n- `POST /api/auth` — Login/register by email. Returns user object.\n\n### Users\n- `GET /api/users/:id` — Get user profile\n- `PUT /api/users/:id` — Update user profile\n- `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` — Set is_host to true\n\n### Properties\n- `GET /api/properties` — List properties with search/filter query params (city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, min_price, max_price, min_bedrooms, min_beds, min_bathrooms, amenities, page, limit)\n- `GET /api/properties/:id` — Get property detail with images, amenities, host info\n- `POST /api/properties` — Create property (host only)\n- `PUT /api/properties/:id` — Update property (owner only)\n- `DELETE /api/properties/:id` — Deactivate property (owner only)\n\n### Property Images\n- `POST /api/property-images` — Add image to property\n- `DELETE /api/property-images/:id` — Remove image\n\n### Bookings\n- `GET /api/bookings` — Get current user's bookings (as guest)\n- `GET /api/host-bookings` — Get bookings for host's properties\n- `POST /api/bookings` — Create booking\n- `PUT /api/bookings/:id` — Update booking status (confirm/cancel)\n\n### Reviews\n- `GET /api/reviews?property_id=X` — Get reviews for a property\n- `POST /api/reviews` — Create review for a completed booking\n\n### Favorites\n- `GET /api/favorites` — Get current user's favorites\n- `POST /api/favorites` — Add favorite\n- `DELETE /api/favorites/:propertyId` — Remove favorite\n\n### Amenities\n- `GET /api/amenities` — List all amenities\n\n## Visual Design\n\n- Clean, modern design inspired by Airbnb's aesthetic\n- White/light gray background with coral/red accent color (#FF5A5F)\n- Rounded cards with subtle shadows\n- Clean typography using system fonts\n- Responsive layout: 1 column mobile, 2 columns tablet, 3-4 columns desktop for property grid\n- Property cards with rounded corners, image at top, info below\n- Sticky booking sidebar on property detail page (desktop)\n- Collapsible navigation sidebar with icons for: Home/Search, My Trips, Hosting, Profile\n- Star ratings displayed with filled/unfilled stars\n- Status badges: pending (yellow), confirmed (green), cancelled (red), completed (blue)\n","numLines":214,"startLine":1,"totalLines":214}}}
