[2026-03-16T03:34:23.086Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K8gmF3iPxX9iX6L5AoXRWv","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have successfully read all 25 requested files from the AirbnbClone app. Here's a complete summary of all the files with their full contents:\n\n## AirbnbClone App - Complete File Contents\n\n### 1. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css`\nGlobal CSS file with Tailwind import and custom CSS theme variables for colors (primary, background, text, status indicators, etc.). Defines layout classes for the app structure including header bar styling, navigation, login button, and responsive design.\n\n### 2. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\nMain app component that sets up React Router with routes for:\n- `/login` - Login page\n- `/` - Home page\n- `/properties/:id` - Property detail page\n- `/trips` - My trips page\n- `/trips/:bookingId/review` - Write review page\n- `/hosting` - Host dashboard\n- `/profile` - User profile\n\nIncludes Sidebar as a persistent header component.\n\n### 3. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`\nHome page with search, filters, and property listings. Features:\n- SearchBar component for location/dates/guests\n- CategoryFilter for property types\n- FiltersPanel for price/rooms/amenities\n- PropertyGrid to display listings\n- Pagination for browsing results\n- Redux state management for properties and favorites\n\n### 4. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Login.tsx`\nLogin/Register page with toggle between modes. Uses:\n- LoginForm and RegisterForm components\n- AuthToggle for switching between modes\n- Redirects logged-in users to home\n\n### 5. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx`\nDetailed property view with:\n- ImageGallery for property photos\n- PropertyHeader with rating and host info\n- PropertyInfo showing amenities and features\n- PropertyDescription\n- AmenitiesList\n- ReviewsSection\n- BookingCard for making reservations\n- HostInfoCard displaying host details\n\n### 6. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\nUser's booking history page showing:\n- TripsTabs component to filter bookings (upcoming/past/cancelled)\n- CancelBookingDialog for cancellation confirmation\n- Requires authentication\n\n### 7. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx`\nHost management dashboard with:\n- StatsOverview showing host metrics\n- ListingsTab for managing properties\n- BookingsTab for managing guest bookings\n- AddListingForm for creating new listings\n- Ability to activate/deactivate properties\n- Requires host status\n\n### 8. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Profile.tsx`\nUser profile page with:\n- ProfileForm for editing user info\n- BecomeHostButton to upgrade to host\n- UserReviewsList showing reviews the user has written\n- Requires authentication\n\n### 9. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/WriteReview.tsx`\nReview submission page with:\n- PropertyBookingContext showing booking details\n- ReviewForm for submitting reviews\n- Success/error states\n- Links back to My Trips\n\n### 10. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`\nHeader navigation component featuring:\n- Airbnb logo\n- Navigation links (Home, My Trips, Hosting, Profile)\n- User menu dropdown with logout\n- Responsive design\n- Keyboard navigation support\n\n### 11. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx`\nSearch form with:\n- Location input\n- Check-in/Check-out date selectors\n- Guest count input\n- Form validation\n- Responsive layout with clear separators\n\n### 12. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CategoryFilter.tsx`\nHorizontal scrollable filter for property types:\n- Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse\n- Toggle selection\n- Accessible with aria-pressed\n\n### 13. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyCard.tsx`\nIndividual property listing card with:\n- Property image with hover effect\n- Property type badge\n- Location and title\n- Beds count\n- Price per night\n- Star rating and review count\n- FavoriteButton component\n- Accessible link to property detail\n\n### 14. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyGrid.tsx`\nGrid layout for property cards with:\n- Responsive columns (1/2/3/4 depending on screen size)\n- Loading state with spinner\n- Empty state message\n- Accessible region announcement\n\n### 15. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingCard.tsx`\nBooking/reservation component featuring:\n- Calendar picker with month navigation\n- Check-in/Check-out date selection\n- Guest count dropdown\n- Price breakdown (nightly + cleaning fee)\n- Booked dates blocking\n- Reserve button with validation\n- Login prompt for unauthenticated users\n- Sticky positioning on desktop\n\n### 16. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ImageGallery.tsx`\nProperty image gallery with:\n- Main image display\n- Thumbnail grid layout\n- Image captions\n- Show all photos button\n- Click to switch main image\n\n### 17. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyHeader.tsx`\nProperty title and host section with:\n- Property title and location\n- Star rating with review count\n- Host avatar and info\n- Host tenure information\n- Scroll-to functionality for reviews and host info\n\n### 18. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyInfo.tsx`\nProperty details section displaying:\n- Property type\n- Max guests\n- Bedrooms count\n- Beds count\n- Bathrooms count\n- Check-in and check-out times\n- Icons for visual representation\n\n### 19. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FiltersPanel.tsx`\nAdvanced filters modal with:\n- Price range inputs\n- Bedroom/bed/bathroom selectors\n- Amenities with category grouping\n- Apply and reset buttons\n- Click-outside and keyboard escape handling\n- Lazy-loads amenities data\n\n### 20. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/LoginForm.tsx`\nLogin form with:\n- Email input field\n- Email validation\n- Error message display\n- Loading state\n- Submit button\n\n### 21. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/RegisterForm.tsx`\nRegistration form with:\n- Name input field\n- Email input field\n- Form validation (name and email required)\n- Error message display\n- Loading state\n- Submit button\n\n### 22. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ReviewsSection.tsx`\nProperty reviews display with:\n- Overall rating summary\n- Category ratings (Cleanliness, Accuracy, Communication, Location, Value)\n- Individual review cards with guest info\n- Pagination (shows 6 initially, can expand)\n- No reviews fallback message\n- Star rating visualization\n\n### 23. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\nBooking card for My Trips page with:\n- Property image\n- Booking status badge with color coding\n- Location and dates\n- Total price\n- Cancel button (if pending/confirmed)\n- Write review button (if completed and not reviewed)\n- Reviewed badge (if completed and reviewed)\n- Click navigation to property detail\n\n### 24. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Pagination.tsx`\nPage navigation component with:\n- Previous/Next buttons\n- Dynamic page number display (ellipsis for large ranges)\n- Current page highlighting\n- Disabled state for first/last pages\n- Accessible with proper ARIA labels\n\n### 25. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/HostInfoCard.tsx`\nHost information section with:\n- Host avatar\n- Host name\n- Years hosting information\n- Member since date\n- Number of listings\n- Host bio\n- Icons for visual clarity\n\nAll files are properly structured with TypeScript, implement accessibility features (ARIA labels, semantic HTML), use Tailwind CSS for styling, and are integrated with Redux for state management."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aecbbe527f621e365 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 61256\ntool_uses: 25\nduration_ms: 29638</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02a601b0-a58d-4ced-bb22-f466b267f498","uuid":"14a30b00-9d94-42d5-9322-51c83c5ed3d5","tool_use_