d directly. I need to break this into manageable tasks and start implementing them systematically. Let me create a task list and begin working through the updates. I'm going back and forth on whether to use the task system or just do the work directly, but the user is asking me to redo the UI now, so I'll work through each component systematically—starting with the header, search bar, and other major sections to make them feel more like Airbnb.\n\nLooking at what needs the most impact, I should prioritize the category filter with icons and the property card image carousel since those are the most distinctive Airbnb features, then handle the header refinements and overall spacing adjustments.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11288,"cache_read_input_tokens":55911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11288,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02a601b0-a58d-4ced-bb22-f466b267f498","uuid":"e6528a35-43f2-426a-9dd3-4df1a89c3c47"}
