gle }: AuthToggleProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"mt-6 text-center\" data-testid=\"auth-toggle\">\n      {mode === 'login' ? (\n        <p className=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">\n          Don&apos;t have an account?{' '}\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            onClick={onToggle}\n            aria-label=\"Switch to register form\"\n            className=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline cursor-pointer\"\n            data-testid=\"auth-toggle-link\"\n          >\n            Register\n          </button>\n        </p>\n      ) : (\n        <p className=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">\n          Already have an account?{' '}\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            onClick={onToggle}\n            aria-label=\"Switch to login form\"\n            className=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline cursor-pointer\"\n            data-testid=\"auth-toggle-link\"\n          >\n            Log In\n          </button>\n        </p>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default AuthToggle\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}}}
[2026-03-16T03:35:59.373Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013naPLRZdUQ9GybGDroc2Wk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the entire codebase. Let me plan the UI overhaul to make it look like the real Airbnb.com. Here's what I need to change:\n\n### Key Airbnb.com UI characteristics:\n\n1. **Header**: \n   - Airbnb logo (the rausch/belo icon only, no text on main pages)\n   - Center: compact search bar pill (Where | When | Who | Search button) directly in header\n   - Right: \"Airbnb your home\" text link, globe icon, hamburger + avatar pill button\n\n2. **Category Filter Bar**: \n   - Vertically stacked icons with text labels below\n   - Scrollable with left/right arrows\n   - Active categories underlined rather than highlighted\n   - Filters button positioned on the right\n\n3. **Property Cards**:\n   - Image carousel with dot indicators and hover-triggered arrow buttons\n   - Location displayed in bold without property type badge\n   - Descriptive text, date range or distance, nightly price, and star rating positioned in the top-right of the text section\n\n4. **Property Detail Page**:\n   - Full-width image gallery with a 5-image grid layout (one large image on the left, four smaller images on the right)\n   - Title positioned above the gallery\n   - Two-column layout beneath with content on the left and booking card on the right\n   - Sections divided by subtle horizontal lines\n\n5. **Login Page**:\n   - Centered modal card with \"Log in or sign up\" header and a top border accent\n   - \"Welcome to Airbnb\" heading\n   - Email input field\n   - Gradient button for continuing\n\nNow I'm prioritizing the key visual updates: adding category icons to the filter, implementing the image carousel for property cards, and refining the search interface.\n\nI'm reconsidering the task structure here—the instructions mention using `add-task` for new work, but also say to complete all subtasks and output `<DONE>` when finished. Looking back at the agent documentation, it seems the worker processes tasks sequentially from the tasks file, so I should probably create tasks rather than implement everything directly.\n\nLet me map out the specific changes needed: updating the theme and footer styling in the CSS, adding SVG icons to the category filter, implementing an image carousel in the property cards, polishing the search bar, and integrating it into the header on the home page. I'll create tasks for each of these components so the worker can handle them systematically.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6877,"cache_read_input_tokens":73187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6877,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02a601b0-a58d-4ced-bb22-f466b267f498","uuid":"8da2d59f-3e7d-4c6f-911f-235f40f1e485"}
